SWOT ANALYSIS

Strengths  
. unique value proposition – The brand creates emotional value and differentiation from generic bookstores.
. Flexible business model – The business can offer both digital ( pdf / ebooks) and printed versions. 

Weakness
New brand recognition – The brand may not yet have strong credibility or public trust.
Limited marketing budget – without significant advertising funds, growth may be slower.

Opportunities 
Social media marketing – Platforms allow affordable brand promotion and targeted advertising.
Corporate gifting market – Companies may order personalized books as gifts for employees or clients.

Threats 
Strong competition – large online retailers and print on demand platforms already exist.
Price competition – Competition may offer cheaper mass-produced alternatives.

